<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Tenggara reports flat year net.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Tenggara reports flat year net.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  17.42   vs	  17.34</p>
<p>    Group share  (cents)    34.2    vs	  34.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   281.10   vs	 211.19</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    24.74   vs	  26.50</p>
<p>    Minorities		   0.14   vs	   1.75</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Tenggara Capital Bhd manufactures timber products and cement.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
